---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Expat Testimonials — Living in Panama" description="Real stories from expats who relocated to Panama. What they found, what surprised them, and what they wish they had known." lang="en">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mt-4 mb-3">Expat Testimonials</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Real stories from people who made the move. What they found, what surprised them, and what they wish they had known before relocating to Panama.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- On the relocation process -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-6">On the Relocation Process</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "It was eye-opening and transformative. The team gave us absolutely everything we needed to feel confident about our move to Boquete. We would have made very costly mistakes without that professional support."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">ST</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">Sarah and Tom D.</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Expats in Boquete — 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "We bought the guide a year ago and have already saved more than it cost us. We used the recommended immigration attorney, bought a car and handled the licenses. Absolutely worth every penny."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">M</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">Marie</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Permanent resident — March 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "We arrived as strangers and left as family. If you're planning to move to Panama, do it well-supported — you won't be disappointed."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">G</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">Gena</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Relocation to Panama — January 2026</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "Having legal, medical, insurance and visa advice all in one place is invaluable. It would have taken me a year to gather all that information on my own, if I'd managed at all."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">L</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">Luiz</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">October 2025</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- On real life as an expat -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-6">On Real Life as an Expat</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "The level of medical care surprised me. My sister, a nurse in California, traveled here alarmed; once she saw the equipment and the care, she said it was more modern than the hospital where she works. That's priceless."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">E</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">Expat resident</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Emergency experience in Boquete</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/15">
          <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg text-slate mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            "The territorial system radically changes the financial equation. My US pension isn't taxed here, and on top of that I get 25% off restaurants and 20% off medical visits. The real purchasing power is impressive."
          </blockquote>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-jade/10 flex items-center justify-center text-jade font-semibold text-sm">R</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm">North American retiree</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs">Pensionado visa holder — Chitré, since 2024</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What surprised expats most -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-6">What Most Surprised Expats</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        {[
          ["🏥", "Medical quality", "Private hospitals affiliated with Johns Hopkins and Cleveland Clinic — at 5–10% of US prices."],
          ["👨‍⚕️", "Doctor accessibility", "Doctors give patients their personal cell number for follow-up. Unheard of in the US."],
          ["💰", "Real purchasing power", "Pensionado discounts stack on top of already-low prices. The savings are real, not theoretical."],
          ["🤝", "Community warmth", "Expat communities are active, welcoming, and organized. You're not alone from day one."],
          ["🌐", "Internet quality", "Fiber internet in cities and Starlink in remote areas — better than many US rural areas."],
          ["🛒", "Familiar shopping", "PriceSmart (equivalent of Costco), Rey, El Machetazo — familiar brands and products."],
          ["🦜", "Nature richness", "900+ bird species, whale watching, marine parks, and volcanoes all within a 6-hour drive."],
          ["💵", "Dollar economy", "No exchange rate to track. What you budget is what you pay — just like at home."],
        ].map(([emoji, label, detail]) => (
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white flex gap-3 items-start">
            <span class="text-xl">{emoji}</span>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm mb-0.5">{label}</p>
              <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">{detail}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What they wish they'd known -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">What Expats Wish They'd Known</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        {[
          ["Rent before you buy", "Almost every experienced expat says the same thing: rent for at least 12 months before purchasing property. Areas feel very different after 6 months of rainy season."],
          ["Get WhatsApp immediately", "Everything in Panama runs on WhatsApp — landlords, doctors, banks, local services, expat groups. It's not optional."],
          ["Don't compare to home", "Panama is not a discount US. It's a different country with its own rhythms, systems, and way of doing things. Embracing that makes the difference."],
          ["The interior is underrated", "Most expats start in Boquete or Panama City. Many discover that smaller towns like Chitré, Volcán, or Pedasí offer a better quality-of-life-to-cost ratio once they're ready."],
          ["Immigration takes time", "The visa process is legitimate and thorough. Budget 6 months for the Pensionado visa, 2–3 years for Friendly Nations permanent residency. A good attorney makes this painless."],
        ].map(([title, detail]) => (
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate text-sm mb-1">{title}</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">{detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Ready to write your own Panama story?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">Start with a personalized assessment — free, no commitment.</p>
      <a href="/en/contact/" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">Contact us →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
